<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Automakers yr shr falls, div declared.</title>
<headline>Automakers yr shr falls, div declared.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     72.4	   vs    78.6</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 10.0	   vs    --</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   127.8	  vs   125.7</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   198.6	  vs   2.7.8</p>
<p>    Tax			 70.6	   vs    81.0</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   52.8	   vs    27.1</p>
<p>    Turnover		  3,432.7	vs    3,196.1</p>
<p>Full name: Automakers Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said intense competition in the new car market impacted on trading margins. It said, however, that the results were in line with forecasts made at the time of the interim report.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
